  "html": "<p>Items may be obtained from these merchants, in some cases for gold, in others for <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a>.  Some of them will also buy loot from you.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Merchants\"</h2>\n<p>There are 12 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Audrey_the_Alchemist\" title=\"Audrey the Alchemist\">Audrey the Alchemist</a></li></ul>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Deward_the_Arms_Merchant\" title=\"Deward the Arms Merchant\">Deward the Arms Merchant</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Draykop_the_Amazon\" title=\"Draykop the Amazon\">Draykop the Amazon</a></li></ul>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fighter_Equipment_Token_Master\" title=\"Fighter Equipment Token Master\">Fighter Equipment Token Master</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>G</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gypsy_Sally\" title=\"Gypsy Sally\">Gypsy Sally</a></li></ul>\n<h3>H</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hughard_the_Arms_Merchant\" title=\"Hughard the Arms Merchant\">Hughard the Arms Merchant</a></li></ul>\n<h3>L</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Louard_the_Arms_Merchant\" title=\"Louard the Arms Merchant\">Louard the Arms Merchant</a></li></ul>\n<h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Equipment_Token_Master\" title=\"Mage Equipment Token Master\">Mage Equipment Token Master</a></li></ul>\n<h3>P</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Pope_Sweet_Geebus\" title=\"Pope Sweet Geebus\">Pope Sweet Geebus</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ranger_Equipment_Token_Master\" title=\"Ranger Equipment Token Master\">Ranger Equipment Token Master</a></li></ul>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sam's_Dungeon_Wholesale\" title=\"Sam's Dungeon Wholesale\">Sam's Dungeon Wholesale</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Samford_the_Hermit\" title=\"Samford the Hermit\">Samford the Hermit</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>\n \n<div class=\"visu